  "published": "2026-10-19T20:20:51.403Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.6.0: documents back into reports. ReportImport reads PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, HTML, MHTML, CSV and XML: a file SSRS2 wrote with the device setting EmbedSource comes back as the report it was rendered from, any other as a report that looks as it does, what it shows as data its datasets and fields. .NET 11 (release candidate 2): lib/net11.0, decimals made of doubles converted as .NET Framework converts them. Letter spacing (ssrs2:LetterSpacing), gradients on text boxes and rectangles, background pictures sized to their box, Aptos at its own widths. With 1.5.1's changes, which was not published: patched cryptography packages (no NU1902 or NU1903 on install). Details: https://ssrs2.net",
